{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120140058454-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120144844\"/><p>現場為興華街一工地。</p><p>深水埗發現懷疑炸彈。今午(20日)12時58分，興華街3號深水埗運動場對開一工地工人報案，指在上址發現2件酒樽型物品，懷疑為爆炸品。警員接報到場，發現一件60乘200毫米的懷疑爆炸物，遂封鎖現場，並召軍火專家到場協助處理，事件有待進一步調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:04:02.840258+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:00:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T07:57:20.092849+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:57:23.383564+00:00","content_hash":"2e9eab6b85fb1b6a73f4b01733dddb00d3c930ba5f8568cc77f62a06d88ba741","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:04:02.840258+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}